Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:01:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add ms_tlsmldsa GODEBUG setting

Keep ML-DSA enabled in crypto/tls by default and allow ms_tlsmldsa=0 to disable all ML-DSA TLS signature algorithms. Apply the setting to advertisement, certificate selection, and handshake verification independently of the TLS profile and cryptography backend. Add focused tests and document the setting.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
