--- a/doc/godebug.md
+++ b/doc/godebug.md
@@ -211,6 +211,11 @@ enforcement of Extended Master Secret in FIPS 140-3 mode. There is no change in
 default behavior. This setting was backported to Go 1.26.6 and Go 1.25.13.
 We plan to remove this setting in Go 1.31.
 
+Microsoft build of Go 1.27 added a new `ms_tlsmldsa` setting that controls whether
+`crypto/tls` enables the ML-DSA-44, ML-DSA-65, and ML-DSA-87 signature algorithms.
+Setting `ms_tlsmldsa=0` disables these algorithms. The default value is
+`ms_tlsmldsa=1`. This setting applies independently of `ms_tlsprofile`.
+
 ### Go 1.26
 
 Go 1.26 added a new `httpcookiemaxnum` setting that controls the maximum number
